flowchart TD
    A[Clinic Owner Login] --> B[Registration & Setup]
    A --> C{First Time User?}
    C -->|Yes| B
    C -->|No| D[Dashboard]
    
    %% Registration & Setup Flow
    B --> B1[Clinic Identity Configuration]
    B1 --> B1a[Clinic Name Input<br/>Real-time validation]
    B1 --> B1b[Logo Upload<br/>File picker modal]
    B1 --> B1c[Contact Details<br/>Phone/Email format validation]
    B1 --> B1d[Location Setting<br/>Google Maps integration]
    B1 --> B1e[Clinic Description<br/>Rich text editor]
    
    B --> B2[Operating Hours Setup]
    B2 --> B2a[Dynamic Schedule Builder<br/>Day-by-day configuration]
    B2a --> B2a1[Working Hours Modal<br/>Time picker per day]
    B2a --> B2a2[Break Times Setup<br/>Lunch hours configuration]
    B2a --> B2a3[Holiday Calendar<br/>Mark closed days]
    
    B --> B3[Specialties & Services]
    B3 --> B3a[Specialty Selection<br/>Searchable library]
    B3 --> B3b[Service Configuration Modal<br/>Name, Duration, Fee]
    B3b --> B3b1[Lab Services Toggle<br/>Conditional configuration]
    
    B --> B4[Payment Frequency Setup]
    B4 --> B4a[Billing Terms Selection<br/>Weekly/Bi-weekly/Monthly]
    B4a --> B4a1[Preview Modal<br/>Estimated deductions]
    B4 --> B4b[Agreement Confirmation<br/>Checkbox validation]
    
    B --> B5[Setup Progress Tracker<br/>Multi-step completion bar]
    B5 --> B6[Auto-generate Clinic Profile]
    B6 --> B7[Create First Staff Account<br/>Prompt modal]
    B7 --> D
    
    %% Dashboard
    D --> D1[Performance Overview<br/>Live metrics display]
    D1 --> D1a[Time Filter Dropdown<br/>Daily/Weekly/Monthly]
    D1 --> D1b[Appointment Counter<br/>Real-time updates]
    D1 --> D1c[Revenue Display<br/>Interactive charts]
    
    D --> D2[Financial Snapshot<br/>Charts & breakdowns]
    D2 --> D2a[Revenue Trends Modal<br/>Line/bar graphs]
    D2 --> D2b[Quick Link Buttons<br/>Jump to Billing]
    
    D --> D3[Appointments Summary<br/>Status tracker]
    D3 --> D3a[Status Badge Legend<br/>Color-coded system]
    
    D --> D4[Staff Activity<br/>Performance snapshot]
    D4 --> D4a[Top Performers Modal<br/>Weekly rankings]
    D4 --> D4b[Activity Log Feed<br/>Real-time updates]
    D4 --> D4c[Quick Add Staff<br/>Creation shortcut]
    
    D --> D5[Smart Alerts Panel<br/>System notifications]
    D5 --> D5a[Alert Details Modal<br/>Issue breakdown]
    
    D --> D6[Customizable Widgets<br/>Dashboard configuration]
    D6 --> D6a[Widget Settings Modal<br/>Add/Remove panels]
    D6 --> D6b[Layout Customization<br/>Drag-and-drop interface]
    
    %% Main Navigation
    D --> E[Workforce Hub]
    D --> F[Clinic Services Hub]
    D --> G[Appointments]
    D --> H[Billings & Payments]
    D --> I[Health Data & Records]
    D --> J[Settings]
    D --> K[Insights & Performance]
    D --> L[Notifications]
    
    %% Workforce Hub
    E --> E1[Staff Account Creation<br/>Doctor/Receptionist forms]
